23	/// A guest-thread task died of a panic. End the run, loudly.
24	///
25	/// WHY THE PROCESS EXITS RATHER THAN PROPAGATING AN ERROR. Tokio's task harness
26	/// catches a panic in a `spawn_local` task and parks it in the `JoinHandle`,
27	/// which nothing polls until `tool_exit`. The run cannot reach `tool_exit`,
28	/// because by then the tool's scheduler is parked waiting for a turn request
29	/// this task will never post, and detcore's `Ivar` has no way to report that
30	/// its writer is gone -- so every other guest thread waits forever and the run
31	/// hangs until an external timeout kills it. There is no live party left to
32	/// hand an error to. detcore reached the same conclusion about its own
